  "text": "Platinum Price History\nThe LBMA London fix for platinum, from 1990 through 2026-09-25, in USD, GBP and EUR. Explore the full history below, or jump to any year.\nGold\nSilver\nPlatinum\nPalladium\nUSD\nGBP\nEUR\nAll (1968→)\n30Y\n20Y\n10Y\n5Y\nLatest (2026-09-25)\n$1,769\nHighest monthly sample\n$2,366\nFeb 2026\nSample high\n$2,366\nFeb 2026\nSample low\n$332\nDec 1991\nSource: LBMA fixing (PM where applicable), per troy ounce. Last available fixing per month; latest month may be incomplete. EUR begins 1999. See the methodology for sampling limits.\nExplore the highest monthly observations →\nPlatinum price by decade\n2020s\n2010s\n2000s\n1990s\nPlatinum price by year\n2026\n2025\n2024\n2023\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019\n2018\n2017\n2016\n2015\n2014\n2013\n2012\n2011\n2010\n2009\n2008\n2007\n2006\n2005\n2004\n2003\n2002\n2001\n2000\n1999\n1998\n1997\n1996\n1995\n1994\n1993\n1992\n1991\n1990\nReady to act on the price? See live platinum quotes on the\nspot dashboard\nor\nshop platinum bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
